    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extinguish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.mp4?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Firefighter Frankie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.mp4?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/1889ac3013548fffb3dbf38b0d1e3246.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/1889ac3013548fffb3dbf38b0d1e3246.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/1889ac3013548fffb3dbf38b0d1e3246.mp4?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Firefighter Frankie</strong>: Take control of the heroic Golden Retriever to save the town, one fire at a time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, Upgrade, and Extinguish</strong>: \ud83d\ude92 Hop in your firetruck, upgrade your gear, and battle raging fires across a vibrant low-poly world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong>: Follow clues and outsmart the fiery culprits behind the chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong>: Enjoy an easy-going firefighting adventure where you can explore and play at your own pace.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extinguish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/72a370dd00d59bff98c706003bb7fac6.mp4?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as Firefighter Frankie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/828a9016067b9fce1f8c15827c2c7721.mp4?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/1889ac3013548fffb3dbf38b0d1e3246.poster.avif?t=1755496200\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428730/extras/1889ac3013548fffb3dbf38b0d1e3246.webm?t=1755496200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s